course: dictionary
lesson: 6357
title: Food words in context
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: You can often learn a new food word from the words around it. «Tomato and mozzarella salad» tells you that mozzarella is something you put in a salad, and a salad is food.
explain: «A ball of mozzarella» shows that mozzarella is soft enough to be shaped into a ball, and «mozzarella sticks» shows it is a snack you can eat. Ask yourself: what kind of thing fits here, and does my meaning still make sense in the sentence?
explain: Read this context carefully: «People also milk goats, sheep, water buffalo, camels, yaks, horses and reindeer; feta is usually sheep's milk and real mozzarella is buffalo milk.» The list is all animals that give milk, and mozzarella is named as a cheese made from one of their milks, so mozzarella is a cheese, not an animal.
fact: Mozzarella is a noun, the name of a food.
fact: «Mozzarella» means a soft, white, mild Italian cheese.
fact: When it is melted, mozzarella becomes stretchy and stringy, which is why it stretches on pizza.
fact: Traditional mozzarella is made from the milk of water buffalo or cows.
fact: Mozzarella is uncountable, so you say «some mozzarella» or «a ball of mozzarella», not «a mozzarella».
exercise: In «tomato and mozzarella salad», what kind of food is mozzarella? | A kind of vegetable | A kind of bread | *A kind of cheese | A kind of fizzy drink
exercise: What happens to mozzarella when it is melted? | It turns bright blue | It goes as hard as a rock | *It becomes stretchy and stringy | It turns into water
exercise: Which animal's milk is traditionally used to make real mozzarella? | Reindeer | Yak | Goat | *Water buffalo
test: What does the word «mozzarella» mean? | A sweet, sticky fruit | *A soft, white, mild Italian cheese | A red, spicy tomato sauce | A crusty bread roll from France
test: What kind of food are «mozzarella sticks»? | Fizzy drinks | *Cheese snacks | Ice creams | Fresh fruit
exam: In the sentence «People also milk goats, sheep, water buffalo, camels, yaks, horses and reindeer; feta is usually sheep's milk and real mozzarella is buffalo milk.», which animal's milk is mozzarella made from? | Sheep | Reindeer | *Water buffalo | Camel
